    "body": "M1-02 CONT-01 completes the reviewed local reminder repair: ordinary runtime unavailability is visible, native bootstrap retries after settled failure while preserving single-flight/ready reuse, partial bootstrap work drains before retry, and the real save/coordinator/scheduler/hook/notice/Retry chain preserves current durable intent and owner/consent fences. Scheduling acknowledgement never claims OS delivery. The maintained daily harness now binds rendered phase/local date and persisted day/journal on every phase entry; cross-owner interaction selects the actual Shelf product button.\n\nMeasured implementation: 9f1409fb2c2a1189e12c6b8f140f108ce2f2da12, tree b080649f12e25edcaf22d3b8b95c7d4424f97357. Fresh forced root tests: 6,067 passes (6,043 mobile +24 console), typecheck/lint pass, zero cached tasks; focused719 overlapping passes; governance53 passes+2 genuine Windows symlink skips. Source contracts148 pass/1 inherited CORE05 exact94 failure, preserved for M1-03. Daily390/375/430, daily-cross-owner390, sign-out390 and retained Shelf/privacy390 pass. Exact intermediate source identities and adverse diagnostics remain preserved; two early phase rows precede the cross-only harness selection fix and are not relabelled as final-head execution.\n\n[CONT-01 review packet](https://github.com/TasfiqJ/onSkin/tree/stage/m1-retained-safety/docs/brain/checkpoints/M1-02/CONT-01) contains strict completion-report.json, readable closeout, commands/environments/SHAs/trees/exits/counts/skips/hashes, selected safe surface evidence and actual CI checkout binding. Independent manifest a74f8d38924807eb7892a05f6ec9477bf9ee3936a456093279eecac183a903bc is verified. Original reports/refusals are unchanged and referenced by commit/path/hash. All47 task identities/dependencies,27 module identities/order,14 worklist meanings and414 fingerprints are preserved.\n\nADR038: retained undo is UNAVAILABLE_RETAINED_APPEND_ONLY, never PASS. Completed controls/copy/accessibility are truthful; completion/outbox history is preserved. Additive owner-bound correction remains required in M2-01 contracts/adapters and M2-02 UI before M2-03/M2-04; no M2 implementation. Actual paid route denial is not positive paid-feature success. Physical native OS delivery/camera/Keychain, native offline cold-start, authentic provider/qualified/clinical/commercial/release axes remain closed.\n\nMeasured-head CI: iOS39504417796 passes source-only; Security39504417794 fails code/static/source-only inventory/review/advisory gates, with secret scanning pass/live Supabase skipped. Quality39504417954 canonical DB118910283042 fails ECR Data limit exceeded in prepareCanonicalPostgresImage before SQL. Repository quality and PostgreSQL15/17 rehearsals pass; both Expo exports pass, and overall Quality completes as failure. Evidence-only delivery CI is refreshed separately and never borrowed as green. Current observations and safe refusal logs are in the packet.\n\nSubmission requires independent Brain review; last Brain verdict remains FIX_REQUIRED. PR9 stays draft/unmerged. Main/M0/PR8/other worktrees/shared dependencies are untouched. No protected DB/Security/workflow/dependency/count/hash/date changes, registry authentication, spend/provider mutation, main promotion, signing/deployment/release or later task. Expiry2026-10-21T00:00:00Z remains unchanged.",
